UPDATE companies SET description='Sheet Metal Solutions, LLC operates from Duluth, Minnesota, in the Lincoln Park Craft District. The company was established in 2013 when Becky and Mark LaTour left their previous jobs to launch the business as a Women Owned Small Business (WOSB). The LaTours built the shop around a simple premise: if a project involves metal, they can likely find a way to execute it.

The shop delivers a broad range of metal fabrication and HVAC services. Core processes include custom stainless steel fabrication (NSF/ANSI 2 certified for food‑service equipment), architectural metalwork, TIG and MIG welding performed both on‑site and off‑site, copper soldering, and dust‑collection system fabrication. They also handle full residential and commercial HVAC installation, service, and replacement—covering furnaces, air conditioning, rooftop units, make‑up air units, exhaust fans, and refrigeration. Additional capabilities span metal siding, gutters, downspouts, flashings, and custom shop fabrication for projects of varying scale.

The customer base spans commercial, industrial, and residential sectors. Notable clients include Castle Danger Brewery in Two Harbors, MN, which relied on SMS for stainless fabrication; Nuss Truck & Equipment, which uses the shop for HVAC projects across Twin Cities locations; and the Black Woods Group (Tavern on the Hill), a restaurant and catering operator. The company also serves homeowners with remodels, new construction, and gutter work.

The founders emphasize employee retention and client satisfaction as differentiating factors. They describe their approach as flexible, with a willingness to accommodate special situations, and they guarantee satisfaction from start to finish. Being bonded and insured in both Minnesota and Wisconsin further supports their ability to work across state lines.', certifications=ARRAY['NSF/ANSI 2','WOSB']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom stainless steel fabrication", "NSF/ANSI 2 certified food\u2011service equipment fabrication", "Architectural metalwork", "TIG welding (on\u2011site and off\u2011site)", "MIG welding (on\u2011site and off\u2011site)", "Copper soldering", "Dust collection system fabrication", "Residential HVAC installation, service, and replacement", "Commercial HVAC installation, service, and replacement", "Industrial HVAC installation, service, and replacement", "Rooftop unit installation", "Make\u2011up air unit installation", "Exhaust fan installation", "Refrigeration system installation and service", "Metal siding installation", "Gutter and downspout fabrication and installation", "Flashing fabrication and installation (window, door, roof, valley, base, wall)", "Custom shop fabrication", "Sheet metal fabrication (general)", "HVAC ductwork fabrication"], "industries": ["Food service", "Beverage production", "Restaurant", "Catering", "Commercial construction", "Industrial manufacturing", "Residential construction", "Architectural metalwork", "Transportation equipment", "HVAC"], "materials": ["Stainless steel", "Copper"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Women Owned Small Business (WOSB) certified", "NSF/ANSI 2 certified stainless steel fabrication for food\u2011service equipment", "Bonded and insured in Minnesota and Wisconsin", "On\u2011site and off\u2011site TIG/MIG welding capability", "Flexible scheduling and prompt response for custom projects"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2013 by Becky and 