UPDATE companies SET description='Sick Fabrication LLC operates from a shop in Las Vegas, Nevada. The business was launched in 2003 by Josey Martin, who began welding as a teenager and had been building sand rails since childhood. Martin’s 20-plus years of hands-on experience anchor the company’s reputation in the local market.

Equipment includes a CNC water plasma table, a CNC plasma cutting table, a milling machine, and a press brake capable of bending material up to 1/2 inch thick and 16 inches long, or up to 1/4 inch thick and 96 inches long. The crew of certified welders handles prototype work, custom one-off projects, and larger production runs of identical parts.

Customers span automotive off-road builders needing roll cages, bumpers, and light bars; construction firms requiring embed plates, handrails, gates, bridges, and shade structures; arts and entertainment clients such as Burning Man art cars, art installations, and theatrical scenery; trade-show exhibitors; firearms manufacturers for milling work; and accessibility contractors modifying homes for handicap access. The company also holds NHTSA Domestic Manufacturer (Final Stage) certification to produce truck beds and trailers.

Sick Fabrication distinguishes itself with a lifetime guarantee on all welds and finished projects, emphasizing precision from its CNC plasma systems that exceed manual capabilities. The Nevada-licensed shop stresses its certified welder team and the owner’s deep fabrication background as the foundation for meeting diverse custom demands.', certifications=ARRAY['Nevada State License']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["MIG welding (steel, stainless steel, aluminum)", "TIG welding (steel, chromoly, stainless steel, aluminum)", "Stick welding (steel, hard facing)", "CNC plasma cutting", "CNC water plasma cutting", "Milling", "Press brake bending (up to 1/2\" thick, 16\" long; up to 1/4\" thick, 96\" long)", "Custom metal fabrication", "Prototype fabrication", "Production runs (large quantities)", "Roll cage fabrication", "Bumper and light bar fabrication", "Off-road vehicle fabrication", "Firearm milling", "Trade show component fabrication", "Shade structure fabrication", "Hand rail fabrication", "Fence and gate fabrication", "Sign fabrication", "Art installation fabrication", "Embed plate (concrete anchor) fabrication", "Target stand fabrication", "Scenery fabrication", "Handicap accessibility modification", "Truck bed and trailer manufacturing (NHTSA certified)", "Repair services"], "industries": ["Automotive (off-road)", "Construction", "Arts & Entertainment", "Trade Shows & Events", "Firearms", "Accessibility/Healthcare", "Transportation (trailers)", "Signage", "Infrastructure"], "materials": ["Steel", "Stainless Steel", "Aluminum", "Chromoly"], "equipment": ["CNC Water Plasma Table", "CNC Plasma Cutting Table", "Milling Machine", "Press Brake (3/8\" to 1/2\" up to 16\" long, 20ga to 1/4\" up to 96\" long)"], "volume": "Prototype to large quantity runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Lifetime guarantee on all welds and finished projects", "NHTSA Domestic Manufacturer (Final Stage) certification for truck beds and trailers", "CNC plasma and wat