UPDATE companies SET description='Sico East Coast, Inc. operates from Sanford, Florida, as the U.S. East Coast arm of the SICO Global Group. The entity was formed in 2016 when Austria-based SICO Technology GmbH acquired the former SGI USA and rebranded it as Sico East Coast Inc. The parent company, founded in 1981 in Bad Bleiberg, Austria, began as a specialist in quartz and silicon processing for the semiconductor industry.

The company manufactures high-purity custom components — quartz, silicon, and technical ceramics — for semiconductor, fiber-optic, and optical applications. Its capabilities span machining of technical ceramics, quartz fabrication, silicon carrier and injector production, and a refurbishing program that includes repair and cleaning of used parts. The global group employs nearly 150 people across five locations in Austria, Singapore, and the United States, with complete fabrication abilities at each site.

Primary customers are semiconductor original equipment manufacturers and fabs that run batch and single-wafer furnaces. Sico supplies furnace parts for various OEM furnace brands and has developed a patented silicon injector that can remain in service for up to three months without particle deposition, reducing downtime and boosting chip yields. The firm also serves the fiber-optic and optical sectors with precision quartz and ceramic components.

Sico differentiates itself through patented manufacturing methods, notably the long-life silicon injector, and maintains ISO 9001:2015 certification across its operations. The company emphasizes sustainability via its refurbishing services, which extend product life and lower costs for customers.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Machining of technical ceramics", "Quartz fabrication", "Silicon carrier production", "Silicon injector production", "Silicon liner production", "Silicon tube production", "Refurbishing of semiconductor parts", "Repair of semiconductor parts", "Cleaning of semiconductor parts", "Custom parts manufacturing for semiconductor industry", "Custom parts manufacturing for fiber optic industry", "Custom parts manufacturing for optical industry"], "industries": ["Semiconductor", "Fiber optic", "Optical"], "materials": ["Quartz", "High-purity silicon", "Technical ceramics"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Patented silicon injector with up to three-month service life", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management", "Global production footprint in Austria, Singapore, and the United States", "Refurbishing, repair, and cleaning services for extended part life", "Expertise across quartz, silicon, and technical ceramics"], "facts_used": ["Sico East Coast Inc. formed in 2016 via acquisition of former SGI USA -> /about-us", "Parent company SICO Technology GmbH founded 1981 in Bad Bleiberg, Austria -> /about-us", "Global group employs nearly 150 people across 5 locations in Austria, Singapore, USA -> /about-us", "Manufactures high-purity custom parts for semiconductor, fiber optic, optical industries -> /", "Capabilities: machining of technical ceramics, quartz fabrication, silicon processing, refurbishing/repair/cleaning -> /, /about-us", "Patented silicon injector with up to three-month lifespan reducing downtime and increasing chip yields -> /about-us", "ISO 9001:201