UPDATE companies SET description='Sikky Manufacturing was founded in 2008 in Rosedale, Maryland. The company began with a focus on the LS engine swap market, developing precision-engineered components for automotive enthusiasts and builders.

The company produces a range of LS swap parts including motor mounts, complete swap kits, shifters, front drive kits, headers, oil pans, air conditioning kits, and transmission adapters. It also offers private label manufacturing services, providing design, testing, and production for other businesses. Core processes include CNC machining of 6061 billet aluminum and stainless steel fabrication, with all products assembled and finished in-house.

Sikky serves the automotive aftermarket, specifically the LS engine swap segment, selling directly to enthusiasts and professional builders through its catalog. It also targets business owners seeking domestic contract manufacturing for custom parts, offering end-to-end private label services from concept to finished product.

The company emphasizes a no-compromise quality standard, stating that every product is built with precision, passion, and an unwavering commitment to perfection. It highlights domestic production as a core value, noting that manufacturing locally supports American jobs and upholds craftsmanship. Its motor mounts are described as for precise fitment and performance.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC machining (6061 billet aluminum)", "Stainless steel fabrication", "Product design and testing", "Private label manufacturing", "LS swap kit assembly", "Motor mount engineering", "Transmission adapter manufacturing", "Header and oil pan fabrication", "Air conditioning kit assembly", "Shifter manufacturing"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "LS engine swap", "Private label manufacturing"], "materials": ["6061 billet aluminum", "Stainless steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Made in USA manufacturing", "CNC machined 6061 billet aluminum and 100% stainless steel construction", "Private label manufacturing services including design, test, and production", "Industry-leading LS swap motor mounts engineered for precise fitment", "No-compromise quality standard with no shortcuts in design or materials"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2008 -> db", "Headquarters in Rosedale, Maryland -> db", "Produces LS swap parts (motor mounts, kits, shifters, headers, oil pans, AC kits, adapters) -> /", "Offers private label manufacturing services (design, test, manufacture) -> /services", "Uses CNC machined 6061 billet aluminum and 100% stainless steel -> /, /services", "Emphasizes Made in USA, no-compromise quality, precision craftsmanship -> /, /services", "Serves automotive aftermarket and LS swap market -> /, /services", "Targets business owners for private label manufacturing -> /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Made in USA by Sikky Manufacturing; P