UPDATE companies SET description='Silfab Solar Inc. operates its U.S. manufacturing headquarters in Burlington, Washington, with additional production facilities in Fort Mill, South Carolina, and a corporate office in Mississauga, Ontario. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but it identifies as a North American solar manufacturer with three domestic factories.

Silfab designs and manufactures photovoltaic modules for residential, commercial, and utility-scale markets. Its product lines include the Elite Series (back-contact technology, up to 420 W), Prime Series (black-on-black residential panels up to 440 W), Commercial Series (high-power-density modules up to 590 W), and Utility NTC bifacial panels (up to 640 W, nearly 23% efficiency). All three North American plants run fully automated production lines with advanced robotics and hold ISO 9001:2015 certification.

The company sells through distributors and installers across the United States and Canada.

Silfab emphasizes that its panels are engineered specifically for North American climate conditions, citing low defect rates and one of the industry''s most comprehensive warranties—25-year product and 30-year linear performance coverage on the Utility series. The Elite Series is marketed as exclusively made in the USA, using conductive backsheet and integrated cell designs to maximize light capture.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Photovoltaic module manufacturing", "Back-contact cell technology (Elite Series)", "Bifacial panel production (Utility NTC)", "Automated production line operation", "ISO 9001:2015 quality management", "Solar panel engineering for North American climates", "Residential, commercial, and utility-scale PV module assembly"], "industries": ["Solar energy", "Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Utility-scale power generation", "Historic preservation", "Tribal energy projects"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Fully automated production lines", "Advanced robotics"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Designed and engineered for North American environmental conditions", "Fully automated production lines with advanced robotics at all three facilities", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management at every location", "Elite Series panels manufactured exclusively in the USA", "25-year product and 30-year linear performance warranty on Utility series"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Burlington, WA and corporate office in Mississauga, ON -> /", "Three North American manufacturing facilities (Burlington WA, Fort Mill SC, Mississauga ON) -> /", "Manufactures residential, commercial, and utility solar panels -> /", "Product lines: Elite, Prime, Commercial, Utility NTC -> /", "Fully automated production lines with advanced robotics -> /", "ISO 9001:2015 certification at all locations -> /", "Sells through distributors and installers in US and Canada -> /", "Project 