UPDATE companies SET description='Simmons Animal Nutrition operates as a division of Simmons Foods, a family-owned business founded in 1949 in Siloam Springs, Arkansas. The company traces its roots to the Simmons family, who have maintained ownership and leadership for over 75 years, emphasizing a ''small company mindset'' despite significant growth.

Today, Simmons Animal Nutrition focuses on private-label and contract manufacturing of wet pet food, producing store-brand products for retailers across North America. The division also develops proprietary animal nutrition formulations for pet food, animal feed, and aquaculture markets. With more than 9,500 team members across the Simmons Foods affiliate network, the operation serves customers in all 50 U.S. states and over 40 countries.

The company''s customer base includes retail chains seeking private-label wet pet food, as well as brands in the pet food, animal feed, and aquaculture sectors. Simmons Prepared Foods, another affiliate, ranks among the top 15 U.S. poultry producers, supplying chicken products to restaurants and retailers worldwide.

Leadership attributes the company''s differentiation to its private, family-owned structure, which enables ''creativity before capital'' and a long-term perspective. CEO Todd Simmons has stated that the organization strives to retain a small-company mindset while pursuing continuous improvement, driven by the belief that there is always a better way.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Private-label wet pet food manufacturing", "Contract manufacturing of wet pet food", "Proprietary animal nutrition product development", "Poultry processing (via Simmons Prepared Foods)", "Pet food formulation and production", "Animal feed ingredient manufacturing"], "industries": ["Pet food", "Animal nutrition", "Animal feed", "Aquaculture", "Poultry"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and privately held since 1949", "Largest North American supplier of store-brand wet pet food", "Integrated poultry, pet food, and animal nutrition operations", "9,500+ team members serving 50 states and 40+ countries", "''Creativity before capital'' philosophy"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1949 -> /about", "Family owned and operated -> /about, /", "Headquarters in Siloam Springs, Arkansas -> /about", "9,500+ team members -> /about", "Private-label and contract manufacturer of wet pet food -> db", "Largest supplier of store-brand wet pet food in North America -> /about", "Proprietary animal nutrition products -> /about", "Serves all 50 states and 40+ countries -> /about", "Top 15 U.S. poultry producer (Simmons Prepared Foods) -> /about", "Quote from Todd Simmons on creativity before capital -> /about", "Simmons Animal Nutrition division president appointment -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "is the leading North American private-label and contract manufacturer of wet pet food.", "founded_year": "1949", "employee_count": "9,500+", "cag