UPDATE companies SET description='PacAero Norton, formerly known as Sinclair Manufacturing Co, operates from Norton, Massachusetts. The business traces its roots to the original Sinclair Manufacturing Co, which was rebranded as PacAero Norton to reflect its focus on advanced hermetic packaging.

