UPDATE companies SET description='Smart Cabling Solutions, Inc. is based in Olathe, Kansas, and was founded in 2001 by Ron Wagner. The company began with a focus on personalized, hands‑on service for commercial network infrastructure. In the same year, Brian Koester, an RCDD‑certified Vice President of Operations, and Jeff Cox, Vice President of Business Development, joined the leadership team, helping the firm build long‑term relationships with customers, vendors, and manufacturers.

