UPDATE companies SET description='Smith operates as an independent electronic-component distributor headquartered in Houston, Texas, with additional global hubs in Amsterdam and Hong Kong. The company was founded in 1984 and has accumulated more than four decades of experience navigating the semiconductor supply chain.

