UPDATE companies SET description='The business is run by Pawel Mierzwa, who oversees production, alongside his father, a business partner, giving the firm a family-run character. From its start, the company has focused on the Dallas–Fort Worth metroplex, offering custom solar and battery solutions to homeowners and businesses.

